  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK av CIVICUS - Effektivitetsrevision 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Management and Control ISK av CIVICUS 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag kommer i f&#xf6;rsta hand att fokusera p&#xe5; en analys av ORG:s interna kontrollsystem f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om dessa kan garantera kvalitet och noggrannhet i hela organisationskedjan. I uppdraget ing&#xe5;r en genomg&#xe5;ng d&#xe4;r rutiner och system f&#xf6;r verksamhets- och ekonomistyrning beskrivs och analyseras. Dessutom ska konsulten l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer avseende f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar som bed&#xf6;ms n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga. I uppdragsn&#xe4;tet ing&#xe5;r &#xe4;ven uppf&#xf6;ljning av observationer, rekommendationer (av revisor) och &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder som vidtagits som svar p&#xe5; dessa (av CIVICUS), fr&#xe5;n ISK-utv&#xe4;rderingen som genomf&#xf6;rdes 2019.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment will primarily focus on an analysis of the ORG&#x2019;s internal control systems in order to determine whether these can guarantee quality and accuracy in the entire organizational chain. The assignment includes a review in which routines and systems for operational and financial control are described and analysed. In addition, the consultant shall submit recommendations in respect of improvements deemed necessary. The assigmnet also include following up on the observations, recomendations (by auditor) and measures taken in response to these (by CIVICUS), from the ISK-assesment carried out in 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
